<title>UK: EU raises distant high quality wheat import duty.</title>
<headline>EU raises distant high quality wheat import duty.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Wednesday raise duties on transatlantic imports of high-quality wheat to 27.10 Ecus a tonne, from 23.68 Ecus, European Commission figures showed.</p>
</text>
